  "title": "Rahul Gandhi’s protest at PM’s residence amid political tensions in India",
  "summary": "Rahul Gandhi and Congress activists staged a protest outside PM’s residence in Delhi, demanding the PM’s resignation after allegations of police misconduct against students protesting the NEET paper leak issue. The government contested the protests, highlighting judicial oversight and opposing the alleged misuse of political privileges.",
